        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p><strong>MB Coudal</strong> was a stand-up comedian until she had three kids and had to get a day job. Journalist, performer, teacher and prolific blogger, she has four blogs: <a href="http://mbcoudal.wordpress.com/ ">faith</a>, <a href="http://runningaground.wordpress.com/">fitness</a>, <a href="http://gettingmyessayspublished.wordpress.com ">writing</a> and <a href="http://mybeautifulnewyork.wordpress.com/">NYC</a>.</p>
